# Voznesenskaya, Republic of Ingushetia

}}
Voznesenskaya () is a rural locality (a stanitsa) in Malgobeksky District, Republic of Ingushetia, Russia. Population:
Geography
This rural locality is located  from Malgobek (the district's administrative centre),  from Magas (capital of Republic of Ingushetia) and  from Moscow. Krasnaya Gorka is the nearest rural locality.
